  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock id="f-21" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;11. As a result of the approved 2023 Stipulation and Offer of Settlement in Docket No. RP22-725-000, a decrease in max tariff rates for firm transportation became effective April 1, 2026 which effects 14 customers and we expect that to result in a decrease in annual firm revenues of 5% compared to the prior 12 months.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedIncreaseOrDecreaseInAnnualRevenuesCausedByImportantRateChangesTextBlock>
