            <td colspan="9" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <div>
                <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(Note 1) Current Tax Liabilities Included in Retained Earnings - As a limited liability company, we do not directly pay federal income tax. Our taxable income or loss is included in the federal income tax returns of our parent. However, the FERC establishes the method of accounting for income taxes. In our balance sheet, income tax liabilities have been calculated as if we were a taxable entity. Current tax liabilities are relieved through retained earnings because DT Midstream Inc. is responsible for the taxes related to Guardian Pipeline, LLC.</span>
